---
layout: layouts/hub.njk
pageTitle: Hostel Games – card games from every hostel in the world
pageDescription: Rules, strategy, cheat sheets and games against bots for the card games people play in hostels all over the world.
themeSwitchLabel: Switch between light and dark mode
---
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="langbar">
      {% include "themeswitch.njk" %}
    </div>
    <h1>Hostel Games</h1>
    <p>The card games people play in hostels all over the world. Learn the rules in minutes, then play.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap hub">
  <h2>Games</h2>
  <ul class="games">
    {%- for game in games %}
    <li>
      {#- Live on hostelgames.com: link to the game's own domain. In the preview (GitHub Pages)
          the games are built next to the hub, under /<path>/. -#}
      <a class="game" href="{{ game.domain + '/' if (site.indexable and game.domain) else '/' + game.path + '/' }}">
        <span class="game-name">{{ game.name }}</span>
        {%- if game.tagline %}
        <span class="game-tagline">{{ game.tagline }}</span>
        {%- endif %}
        <span class="game-meta">
          {{- game.languages.length }} languages
          {%- if "play" in game.pages %} · play against bots{% endif %}
          {%- if game.players %} · {{ game.players.min }}–{{ game.players.max }} players{% endif %}
          {%- if game.duration %} · {{ game.duration }}{% endif %}
        </span>
        {%- if game.status == "draft" %}
        <span class="game-draft">Draft – preview only</span>
        {%- endif %}
      </a>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
